---
description: Project testing conventions (RTL, Playwright, RLS SQL tests)
globs:
  - '**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}'
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Cover new features and bug fixes; don’t skip tests without reason
- Unit: Jest + RTL — query by role/label/text; assert behavior, not internals
- React Query hooks: wrap with a `QueryClient` (`retry: false`)
- E2E: Playwright for critical flows
- RLS: SQL tests under `scripts/tests/` for allow/deny by role
- Colocate `*.test.ts(x)` with the code under test when practical
